#. from yeager:qgis
msgid "This algorithm creates a copy of the input layer and adds a new field for every unique key in the HStore field.\nThe expected field list is an optional comma separated list. By default, all unique keys are added. If this list is specified, only these fields are added and the HStore field is updated."
