msgid "This algorithm snaps the geometries in a layer. Snapping can be done either to the geometries from another layer, or to geometries within the same layer."
msgstr "Denna algoritm snappar geometrier i ett lager. Snappningen kan göras antingen mot geometrier i ett annat lager eller mot geometrier i samma lager."

