msgstr "kontrollera,geometri,skärning"

#. from yeager:qgis
msgid "This algorithm checks self-intersecting geometries.\nSelf-intersecting geometries are errors."
msgstr "Denna algoritm kontrollerar självskärande geometrier.\nSjälvskärande geometrier är fel."

