msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">The elevation will be taken from the mesh vertices.</span></p><p>Elevation scaling and offset can be used to manually correct elevation values from the layer. The scale is applied to the raster values before adding the offset.</p></body></html>"
