#. from yeager:qgis
msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">The mesh layer is associated with a fixed elevation range.</span></p><p>This mode can be used when a layer has a single fixed elevation, or a range (slice) of elevation values. If a range is specified, mesh values will be extruded over this range.</p></body></html>"
