msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Experimental plugins are generally unsuitable for production use.</span> These plugins are in early stages of development, and should be considered 'incomplete' or 'proof of concept' tools. QGIS does not recommend installing these plugins unless you intend to use them for testing purposes.</p></body></html>"
