#. from yeager:qgis
msgid "The QGIS community resources are managed by the Community Team (Community Manager and Assistants). With numerous contributors they keep contact to the community, take care of QGIS events, documentation, GUI translations, and ensure smooth running of the QGIS.org online experience including web sites, blog, and mailing lists."
msgstr "QGIS community-resurser hanteras av Community Team (Community Manager och assistenter). Med många bidragsgivare håller de kontakten med communityn, tar hand om QGIS-evenemang, dokumentation, GUI-översättningar och ser till att QGIS.org-upplevelsen online fungerar smidigt, inklusive webbplatser, blogg och e-postlistor."

#. from yeager:qgis
msgid "Current Community Team Leaders:"
