msgstr "`Design Patterns <https://www.amazon.com/Design-Patterns-Elements-Reusable-Object-Oriented/dp/0201633612>`_, GoF"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-23887a1829a9fa0b2c2ab67a278ad367
msgid "You should also really read this article from Qt Quarterly on `designing Qt style (APIs) <https://doc.qt.io/archives/qq/qq13-apis.html>`_"
msgstr "Du bör också verkligen läsa den här artikeln från Qt Quarterly om `designing Qt style (APIs) <https://doc.qt.io/archives/qq/qq13-apis.html>`_"

