msgid ":ref:`PyQGIS Cookbook <PyQGIS-Developer-Cookbook>`"
msgstr ":ref:`PyQGIS Cookbook <PyQGIS-Developer-Cookbook>`"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-01d975e4afe18516a4ab896d49c757aa
