#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-197b332ca4911a17dbffdd1414fe1e26
msgid "Save the project file directly from the print layout window."
msgstr "Spara projektfilen direkt från fönstret för utskriftslayout."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-197b332ca4911a17dbffdd1414fe1e26
msgid "Create a new and blank print layout with |newLayout| :guilabel:`New Layout...`."
msgstr "Skapa en ny och tom utskriftslayout med |newLayout| :guilabel:`New Layout...`."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-197b332ca4911a17dbffdd1414fe1e26
msgid "|duplicateLayout| :guilabel:`Duplicate Layout...` : Create a new print layout by duplicating the current one."
msgstr "|duplicateLayout| :guilabel:`Duplicate Layout...` : Skapa en ny utskriftslayout genom att duplicera den nuvarande."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-197b332ca4911a17dbffdd1414fe1e26
msgid "Remove the current layout with |deleteSelected| :guilabel:`Delete Layout...`."
msgstr "Ta bort den aktuella layouten med |deleteSelected| :guilabel:`Ta bort layout...`."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-197b332ca4911a17dbffdd1414fe1e26
msgid "Open the |layoutManager| :guilabel:`Layout Manager...`."
msgstr "Öppna |layoutManager| :guilabel:`Layouthanterare...`."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-197b332ca4911a17dbffdd1414fe1e26
msgid ":menuselection:`Layouts -->` : Open an existing print layout."
msgstr ":menuselection:`Layouts -->` : Öppna en befintlig utskriftslayout."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-197b332ca4911a17dbffdd1414fe1e26
msgid "Once the layout is designed, with |fileSaveAs| :guilabel:`Save as Template` and |fileOpen| :guilabel:`Add Items from Template` icons, you can save the current state of a print layout session as a :file:`.qpt` template file and load its items again in another session/print layout."
msgstr "När layouten har utformats kan du med ikonerna |fileSaveAs| :guilabel:`Spara som mall` och |fileOpen| :guilabel:`Add Items from Template` spara det aktuella läget i en utskriftslayoutsession som en :file:`.qpt`-mallfil och ladda dess objekt igen i en annan session/utskriftslayout."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-197b332ca4911a17dbffdd1414fe1e26
msgid "In the :menuselection:`Layout` menu, there are also powerful ways to share geographical information produced with QGIS that can be included in reports or published. These tools are |saveMapAsImage| :guilabel:`Export as Image...`, |saveAsPDF| :guilabel:`Export as PDF...`, |saveAsSVG| :guilabel:`Export as SVG...` and |filePrint| :guilabel:`Print...`."
msgstr "I menyn :menuselection:`Layout` finns det också kraftfulla sätt att dela geografisk information som producerats med QGIS och som kan inkluderas i rapporter eller publiceras. Dessa verktyg är |saveMapAsImage| :guilabel:`Export as Image...`, |saveAsPDF| :guilabel:`Export as PDF...`, |saveAsSVG| :guilabel:`Export as SVG...` och |filePrint| :guilabel:`Print...`."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-197b332ca4911a17dbffdd1414fe1e26
