msgstr ":menuselection:`GRASS --> r.reclass`"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-376da8ddc3dd5364e6dc1e05f71111e0
msgid "with the following rules::"
msgstr "med följande regler::"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-376da8ddc3dd5364e6dc1e05f71111e0
msgid "You can use the text file ``reclass_south.txt`` provided. Note that with these simple text files we can create also very complex reclassifications."
msgstr "Du kan använda textfilen ``reclass_south.txt`` som tillhandahålls. Observera att med dessa enkla textfiler kan vi skapa även mycket komplexa omklassificeringar."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-376da8ddc3dd5364e6dc1e05f71111e0
msgid "We want to build a large farm, so we select only large (> 100 ha) contiguous areas:"
msgstr "Vi vill bygga en stor gård, så vi väljer bara stora (> 100 ha) sammanhängande områden:"

