msgid "In addition to the operations described under *Home*, the context menu allows you to :guilabel:`Rename Favorite...` and :guilabel:`Remove Favorite`."
msgstr "Förutom de åtgärder som beskrivs under *Home* kan du via snabbmenyn :guilabel:`Rename Favorite...` och :guilabel:`Remove Favorite`."

