#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-7b65b77fbaf7806d9659128d7410344e
msgid "Raster Properties Dialog"
msgstr "Dialog för egenskaper för raster"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-7b65b77fbaf7806d9659128d7410344e
msgid "Raster data is made up of pixels (or cells), and each pixel has a value. It is commonly used to store various types of data, including:"
msgstr "Rasterdata består av pixlar (eller celler) och varje pixel har ett värde. Det används ofta för att lagra olika typer av data, t.ex:"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-7b65b77fbaf7806d9659128d7410344e
msgid "Imagery, such as satellite images, digital aerial photographs, scanned maps"
msgstr "Bildmaterial, t.ex. satellitbilder, digitala flygfoton, skannade kartor"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-7b65b77fbaf7806d9659128d7410344e
msgid "Elevation data, such as digital elevation models (DEMs), digital terrain models (DTMs)"
msgstr "Höjddata, t.ex. digitala höjdmodeller (DEM), digitala terrängmodeller (DTM)"

