msgstr "**Algoritm-ID**: ``gdal:pcttorgb```"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-33ddae0642f4fa21dfcacde56a5d3079
msgid "Creates vector polygons for all connected regions of pixels in the raster sharing a common pixel value. Each polygon is created with an attribute indicating the pixel value of that polygon."
msgstr "Skapar vektorpolygoner för alla anslutna regioner av pixlar i rastret som delar ett gemensamt pixelvärde. Varje polygon skapas med ett attribut som anger polygonens pixelvärde."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-33ddae0642f4fa21dfcacde56a5d3079
msgid "This algorithm is derived from the `GDAL polygonize utility <https://gdal.org/en/latest/programs/gdal_polygonize.html>`_."
msgstr "Den här algoritmen är hämtad från `GDAL polygonize utility <https://gdal.org/en/latest/programs/gdal_polygonize.html>`_."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-33ddae0642f4fa21dfcacde56a5d3079
msgid "If the raster is multiband, choose the band you want to use"
msgstr "Om rastret är multibandigt väljer du det band du vill använda"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-33ddae0642f4fa21dfcacde56a5d3079
