msgstr "``MAX_ATTEMPTS``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Default: 200"
msgstr "Standard: 200"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Maximum number of attempts to place the points"
msgstr "Maximalt antal försök att placera ut poängen"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Algorithm ID**: ``native:randompointsinextent``"
msgstr "**Algoritm-ID**: ``native:randompointsinextent``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Creates a new point layer with a given number of random points, all of them within the extent of a given layer."
msgstr "Skapar ett nytt punktlager med ett givet antal slumpmässiga punkter, som alla ligger inom ett givet lagers utsträckning."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Input polygon layer defining the area"
msgstr "Polygonlager för inmatning som definierar området"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Algorithm ID**: ``qgis:randompointsinlayerbounds``"
msgstr "**Algoritm-ID**: ``qgis:randompointsinlayerbounds``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Creates a point layer with points placed inside the polygons of another layer."
msgstr "Skapar ett punktlager med punkter som placeras inuti polygonerna i ett annat lager."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "For each feature (polygon / multi-polygon) geometry in the input layer, the given number of points is added to the result layer."
msgstr "För varje geometri (polygon/multipolygon) i inmatningslagret läggs det angivna antalet punkter till i resultatlagret."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Per feature and global minimum distances can be specified in order to avoid points being too close in the output point layer. If a minimum distance is specified, it may not be possible to generate the specified number of points for each feature. The total number of generated points and missed points are available as output from the algorithm."
msgstr "Minimiavstånd per funktion och globala minimiavstånd kan anges för att undvika att punkterna ligger för nära varandra i det utgående punktlagret. Om ett minimiavstånd anges kanske det inte är möjligt att generera det angivna antalet punkter för varje funktion. Det totala antalet genererade punkter och missade punkter finns tillgängliga som utdata från algoritmen."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The illustration below shows the effect of per feature and global minimum distances and zero/non-zero minimum distances (generated with the same seed, so at least the first point generated will be the same)."
msgstr "Illustrationen nedan visar effekten av minimiavstånd per funktion och globala minimiavstånd samt minimiavstånd noll/icke-noll (genererade med samma frö, så åtminstone den första genererade punkten blir densamma)."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Ten points per polygon feature, *left*: min. distances = 0, *middle*: min.distances = 1, *right*: min. distance = 1, global min. distance = 0"
msgstr "Tio punkter per polygonfunktion, *vänster*: min. avstånd = 0, *mitt*: min. avstånd = 1, *höger*: min. avstånd = 1, globalt min. avstånd = 0"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The maximum number of tries per point can be specified. This is only relevant for non-zero minimum distance."
msgstr "Det maximala antalet försök per punkt kan anges. Detta är endast relevant för minsta avstånd som inte är noll."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "A seed for the random number generator can be provided, making it possible to get identical random number sequences for different runs of the algorithm."
msgstr "Ett frö för slumptalsgeneratorn kan tillhandahållas, vilket gör det möjligt att få identiska slumptalssekvenser för olika körningar av algoritmen."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The attributes of the polygon feature on which a point was generated can be included (:guilabel:`Include polygon attributes`)."
msgstr "Attributen för den polygon på vilken en punkt genererades kan inkluderas (:guilabel:`Include polygon attributes`)."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "If you want approximately the same point density for all the features, you can data-define the number of points using the area of the polygon feature geometry."
msgstr "Om du vill ha ungefär samma punkttäthet för alla funktioner kan du datadefiniera antalet punkter med hjälp av ytan för polygonfunktionens geometri."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid ":ref:`qgisrandompointsinsidepolygons`"
msgstr ":ref:`qgisrandompointsinsidepolygons`"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Input polygon layer**"
msgstr "**Polygonlager för inmatning**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Number of points for each feature**"
msgstr "**Antal poäng för varje funktion**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The minimum distance between points within one polygon feature"
msgstr "Det minsta avståndet mellan punkter inom en polygonfunktion"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Random points in polygons**"
msgstr "**Slumpmässiga punkter i polygoner**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Global minimum distance between points**"
msgstr "**Globalt minsta avstånd mellan punkter**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``MIN_DISTANCE_GLOBAL``"
msgstr "``MIN_DISTANCE_GLOBAL``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The global minimum distance between points. Should be smaller than the *Minimum distance between points (per feature)* for that parameter to have an effect."
msgstr "Det globala minsta avståndet mellan punkter. Bör vara mindre än *Minsta avstånd mellan punkter (per funktion)* för att den parametern ska ha någon effekt."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Maximum number of search attempts (for Min. dist. > 0)**"
msgstr "**Maximalt antal sökförsök (för Min. dist. > 0)**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``MAX_TRIES_PER_POINT``"
msgstr "``MAX_TRIES_PER_POINT``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The maximum number of tries per point. Only relevant if the minimum distance between points is set (and greater than 0)."
msgstr "Det maximala antalet försök per punkt. Endast relevant om det minsta avståndet mellan punkterna är inställt (och större än 0)."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Random seed**"
msgstr "**Slumpmässigt frö**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``SEED``"
msgstr "``SEED``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The seed to use for the random number generator."
msgstr "Det frö som ska användas för slumptalsgeneratorn."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Include polygon attributes**"
msgstr "**Inkludera polygonattribut**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``INCLUDE_POLYGON_ATTRIBUTES``"
msgstr "``INCLUDE_POLYGON_ATTRIBUTES``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "If set, a point will get the attributes from the line on which it is placed."
msgstr "Om den är inställd kommer en punkt att få attributen från den linje som den är placerad på."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Number of features with empty or no geometry**"
msgstr "**Antal funktioner med tom eller ingen geometri**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``FEATURES_WITH_EMPTY_OR_NO_GEOMETRY``"
msgstr "``FEATURES_WITH_EMPTY_OR_NO_GEOMETRY``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Total number of points generated**"
msgstr "**Totalt antal genererade poäng**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``OUTPUT_POINTS``"
msgstr "``OUTPUT_POINTS``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Number of missed points**"
msgstr "**Antal missade poäng**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``POINTS_MISSED``"
msgstr "``POINTS_MISSED``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The number of points that could not be generated due to the minimum distance constraint."
msgstr "Antalet punkter som inte kunde genereras på grund av minimiavståndsbegränsningen."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Number of features with missed points**"
msgstr "**Antal funktioner med missade poäng**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``POLYGONS_WITH_MISSED_POINTS``"
msgstr "``POLYGONS_WITH_MISSED_POINTS``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Not including features with empty or no geometry"
msgstr "Inkluderar inte funktioner med tom eller ingen geometri"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Algorithm ID**: ``native:randompointsinpolygons``"
msgstr "**Algoritm-id**: ``native:randompointsinpolygons``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Creates a new point layer with a given number of random points inside each polygon of the input polygon layer."
msgstr "Skapar ett nytt punktlager med ett givet antal slumpmässiga punkter i varje polygon i det inmatade polygonlagret."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Two sampling strategies are available:"
msgstr "Två provtagningsstrategier finns tillgängliga:"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Points count: number of points for each feature"
msgstr "Antal poäng: antal poäng för varje funktion"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Points density: density of points for each feature"
msgstr "Poängtäthet: täthet av poäng för varje funktion"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid ":ref:`qgisrandompointsinpolygons`"
msgstr ":ref:`qgisrandompointsinpolygons`"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Sampling strategy**"
msgstr "**Strategi för urval**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``STRATEGY``"
msgstr "``STRATEGY``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Sampling strategy to use. One of:"
msgstr "Samplingsstrategi att använda. En av:"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "0 --- Points count: number of points for each feature"
msgstr "0 --- Antal poäng: antal poäng för varje funktion"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "1 --- Points density: density of points for each feature"
msgstr "1 --- Poängtäthet: antal poäng för varje funktion"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Point count or density**"
msgstr "**Punktantal eller täthet**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``VALUE``"
msgstr "``VALUE``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The number or density of points, depending on the chosen :guilabel:`Sampling strategy`."
msgstr "Antalet punkter eller deras täthet, beroende på vald :guilabel:`Samplingsstrategi`."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Algorithm ID**: ``qgis:randompointsinsidepolygons``"
msgstr "**Algoritm-ID**: ``qgis:randompointsinsidepolygons``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Creates a point layer with points placed on the lines of another layer."
msgstr "Skapar ett punktlager med punkter som placeras på linjerna i ett annat lager."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "For each feature (line / multi-line) geometry in the input layer, the given number of points is added to the result layer."
msgstr "För varje geometrisk funktion (linje/flertal linjer) i inmatningslagret läggs det angivna antalet punkter till i resultatlagret."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Five points per line feature, *left*: min. distances = 0, *middle*: min.distances != 0, *right*: min. distance != 0, global min. distance = 0"
msgstr "Funktion med fem punkter per linje, *vänster*: min. avstånd = 0, *mitt*: min.avstånd != 0, *höger*: min. avstånd != 0, globalt min. avstånd = 0"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The attributes of the line feature on which a point was generated can be included (:guilabel:`Include line attributes`)."
msgstr "Attributen för den linjefunktion på vilken en punkt genererades kan inkluderas (:guilabel:`Include line attributes`)."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "If you want approximately the same point density for all the line features, you can data-define the number of points using the length of the line feature geometry."
msgstr "Om du vill ha ungefär samma punkttäthet för alla linjefunktioner kan du datadefiniera antalet punkter med hjälp av längden på linjefunktionens geometri."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid ":ref:`qgisrandompointsalongline`"
msgstr ":ref:`qgisrandompointsalongline`"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Input line layer**"
msgstr "**Inmatningslinjelager**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Minimum distance between points (per feature)**"
msgstr "**Minsta avstånd mellan punkterna (per funktion)**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The minimum distance between points within one line feature"
msgstr "Det minsta avståndet mellan punkter inom en linjefunktion"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Random points on lines**"
msgstr "**Slumpmässiga punkter på linjer**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Include line attributes**"
msgstr "**Inkludera linjeattribut**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``INCLUDE_LINE_ATTRIBUTES``"
msgstr "``INCLUDE_LINE_ATTRIBUTES``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``LINES_WITH_MISSED_POINTS``"
msgstr "``LINES_WITH_MISSED_POINTS``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``POINTS_GENERATED``"
msgstr "``POINTS_GENERATED``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Algorithm ID**: ``native:randompointsonlines``"
msgstr "**Algoritm-ID**: ``native:randompointsonlines``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Converts a raster layer to a vector layer, by creating point features for each individual pixel's center in the raster layer. Any NoData  pixels are skipped in the output."
msgstr "Konverterar ett rasterlager till ett vektorlager genom att skapa punktfunktioner för varje enskild pixels centrum i rasterlagret. Alla NoData-pixlar hoppas över i utdata."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``RASTER_BAND``"
msgstr "``RASTER_BAND``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Raster band to extract data from"
msgstr "Rasterband att extrahera data från"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Field name**"
msgstr "**Fältets namn**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Default: 'VALUE'"
msgstr "Standard: 'VÄRDE'"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Name of the field to store the raster band value"
msgstr "Namn på det fält där värdet för rasterbandet lagras"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Vector points**"
msgstr "**Vektorpunkter**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Specify the resulting point layer of pixels centroids. :ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"
msgstr "Ange det resulterande punktlagret med pixlarnas centroider. :ref:`En av <output_parameter_widget>`:"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Resulting point layer with pixels centroids"
msgstr "Resulterande punktlager med pixlarnas centroider"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Algorithm ID**: ``native:pixelstopoints``"
msgstr "**Algoritm-ID**: ``native:pixelstopoints``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Converts a raster layer to a vector layer, by creating polygon features for each individual pixel's extent in the raster layer. Any NoData  pixels are skipped in the output."
msgstr "Konverterar ett rasterlager till ett vektorlager genom att skapa polygonfunktioner för varje enskild pixels utbredning i rasterlagret. Eventuella NoData-pixlar hoppas över i utdata."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Vector polygons**"
msgstr "**Vektorpolygoner**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Specify the resulting polygon layer of pixel extents. :ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"
msgstr "Ange det resulterande polygonlagret med pixelutsträckningar. :ref:`En av <output_parameter_widget>`:"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Resulting polygon layer of pixel extents"
msgstr "Resulterande polygonlager med pixelexterienter"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Algorithm ID**: ``native:pixelstopolygons``"
msgstr "**Algoritm-id**: ``native:pixelstopolygons``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Creates a new point layer with its points placed in a regular grid within a given extent."
msgstr "Skapar ett nytt punktlager med punkterna placerade i ett regelbundet rutnät inom en given utsträckning."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "The grid is specified either by the spacing between the points (same spacing for all dimensions) or by the number of points to generate. In the latter case, the spacing will be determined from the extent. In order to generate a full rectangular grid, at least the number of points specified by the user is generated for the latter case."
msgstr "Rutnätet specificeras antingen genom avståndet mellan punkterna (samma avstånd för alla dimensioner) eller genom antalet punkter som ska genereras. I det senare fallet kommer avståndet att bestämmas utifrån omfattningen. För att generera ett helt rektangulärt rutnät genereras i det senare fallet minst det antal punkter som användaren har angett."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Random offsets to the point spacing can be applied, resulting in a non-regular point pattern."
msgstr "Slumpmässiga förskjutningar av punktavståndet kan tillämpas, vilket resulterar i ett oregelbundet punktmönster."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Input extent (xmin, xmax, ymin, ymax)**"
msgstr "**Input omfattning (xmin, xmax, ymin, ymax)**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Point spacing/count**"
msgstr "**Punktavstånd/antal**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``SPACING``"
msgstr "``SPACING``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Default: 100"
msgstr "Standard: 100"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Spacing between the points, or the number of points, depending on whether ``Use point spacing`` is checked or not."
msgstr "Avståndet mellan punkterna, eller antalet punkter, beroende på om ``Use point spacing`` är markerat eller inte."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Initial inset from corner (LH side)**"
msgstr "**Initialinsats från hörn (vänster sida)**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``INSET``"
msgstr "``INSET``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "Offsets the points relative to the upper left corner. The value is used for both the X and Y axis."
msgstr "Förskjuter punkterna i förhållande till det övre vänstra hörnet. Värdet används för både X- och Y-axeln."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "**Apply random offset to point spacing**"
msgstr "**Tillämpa slumpmässig förskjutning av punktavståndet**"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "``RANDOMIZE``"
msgstr "``RANDOMIZE``"

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5040259c1647426ef0fe5278f81b076b
msgid "If checked the points will have a random spacing"
msgstr "Om kryssrutan är markerad kommer punkterna att ha ett slumpmässigt avstånd"

