msgid "Then, according to your HTTP server, you should configure the **DISPLAY** parameter or directly use **xvfb-run**."
msgstr "Sedan ska du, beroende på din HTTP-server, konfigurera parametern **DISPLAY** eller direkt använda **xvfb-run**."

#. from transifex:qgis-qgis-documentation-5d281e2637e5bf9bb2ac4e9ea19331a9
